    "why": "The student must interpret the table showing Diego’s earnings and translate it into a mathematical relationship between the number of windows washed and dollars earned. This involves recognizing and creating a numerical representation (a rate) from a tabular form, which aligns with the practice of representing data and relationships using numerical and symbolic forms.",
