    "likely_errors": "Students may make arithmetic errors (e.g., miscalculating 30 ÷ 27 or 90 ÷ 81), incorrectly apply the rate (e.g., using 10/9 instead of 10/9), or fail to check if an equation fits the data. These errors are common and moderately likely, especially under time pressure."
  }
],
